  "description": "SIRMIS crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H100 Gd8 N16 O50,15(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1C (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2C (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.613-5.185 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.87-179.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd8(μ3-O)4(L)8(CH3COO)4(CO3)2]·15H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
